---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | IELTS Corner"
  description="Privacy policy for IELTS Corner. Learn what data is collected, why it is used, and how you can request changes."
  type="page"
>
  <section class="section" style="padding-top: var(--s-6);">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p style="color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: var(--s-4);">Last updated: March 18, 2026</p>

    <div class="stack" style="gap: var(--s-4);">
      <div>
        <h2>Overview</h2>
        <p>
          IELTS Corner collects only the information needed to run the site, provide paid services,
          answer messages, and send the newsletter when someone chooses to subscribe.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2>1. Information we collect</h2>
        <p><strong>Information you send directly:</strong></p>
        <ul>
          <li>Name and email address in forms or messages</li>
          <li>Writing samples or essays submitted for review</li>
          <li>Payment and purchase details handled through the payment provider</li>
          <li>Any other information you choose to include in a message</li>
        </ul>

        <p><strong>Information collected automatically:</strong></p>
        <ul>
          <li>Basic device and browser information</li>
          <li>Pages visited and general usage data</li>
          <li>Referral source and approximate visit patterns</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2>2. Why the information is used</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>To provide tutoring, AI writing feedback, and subscription access</li>
          <li>To respond to questions and support requests</li>
          <li>To send newsletters only to people who subscribed</li>
          <li>To improve the site and understand which pages are being used</li>
          <li>To meet legal, billing, or record-keeping requirements where necessary</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2>3. Payments and third-party services</h2>
        <p>
          Payments are handled by third-party providers such as Stripe or PayPal. IELTS Corner does
          not store full card details on its own servers.
        </p>
        <p>
          The site may also rely on hosting, analytics, email, and form-processing providers to operate normally.
          Those providers only receive the information needed for their part of the service.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2>4. Newsletter and marketing emails</h2>
        <p>
          If you subscribe to the newsletter, your email address is stored for that purpose. Every digest email
          should include an unsubscribe path. You can also contact us directly if you want to be removed.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2>5. Data sharing</h2>
        <p>
          IELTS Corner does not sell personal information. Information is only shared when necessary to run
          the service, process payments, comply with law, or respond to a direct user request.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2>6. Data security</h2>
        <p>
          Reasonable steps are taken to protect personal information, including the use of secure connections
          and limited access. No internet-based system can promise absolute security, but the goal is to keep data handling careful and limited.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2>7. Your choices</h2>
        <p>You can contact IELTS Corner to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Ask what personal information is held about you</li>
          <li>Correct inaccurate information</li>
          <li>Request deletion where that is legally and operationally possible</li>
          <li>Stop receiving newsletter emails</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2>8. Children</h2>
        <p>
          The site is not designed for children under 13. If information from a child is discovered,
          it will be removed as quickly as reasonably possible.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2>9. Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p>
          This page may be updated when the service changes. The latest version will always appear here with the updated date.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2>10. Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about privacy can be sent through the <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
